@   IN SOA  epc.com.gecko   root.com.gecko. (
    2017031301 ; serial
    1D         ; refresh
    1H         ; retry
    1W         ; expire
    3H         ; minimum
)            

$ORIGIN         com.gecko.
com.gecko.      IN      NS      epc.com.gecko.
epc                     IN      A       127.0.0.1
*                       IN      A       192.168.200.20
